📘 BTRFS RAID PROFILES — DETAILED REFERENCE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Btrfs supports several RAID-like data profiles, controlling how
data and metadata chunks are distributed across multiple devices.

Unlike traditional mdadm RAID, Btrfs operates at the *chunk level*,
allowing live profile conversion and mixing of different drive sizes.

